 136:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****      =================================
 137:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****      [..]    
 138:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Start the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Start() 
 139:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) To read the DAC last data output value, use the HAL_DAC_GetValue() function.
 140:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Stop the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Stop()
