 145:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) Start the DAC peripheral using HAL_DAC_Start_DMA(), at this stage the user specify the l
ARM GAS  C:\Users\24705\AppData\Local\Temp\ccIDpHTN.s 			page 4


 146:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****            of data to be transferred at each end of conversion
 147:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) At the middle of data transfer HAL_DAC_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_ConvHalfCp
 148:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****            function is executed and user can add his own code by customization of function pointer 
 149:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh2()
 150:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) At The end of data transfer HAL_DAC_ConvCpltCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_ConvHalfCpltCallb
 151:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****            function is executed and user can add his own code by customization of function pointer 
 152:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****            HAL_DAC_ConvCpltCallbackCh1() or HAL_DACEx_ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh2()
 153:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****        (+) In case of transfer Error, HAL_DAC_ErrorCallbackCh1() function is executed and user can 
