 162:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****     *** Callback registration ***
 163:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****     =============================================
 164:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****     [..]
 165:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       The compilation define  USE_HAL_DAC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1
 166:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 167:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c **** 
 168:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****     Use Functions HAL_DAC_RegisterCallback() to register a user callback,
 169:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       it allows to register following callbacks:
 170:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvCpltCallbackCh1     : callback when a half transfer is completed on Ch1.             
 171:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ConvHalfCpltCallbackCh1 : callback when a transfer is completed on Ch1.
 172:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       (+) ErrorCallbackCh1        : callback when an error occurs on Ch1.
