 207:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       Exception done for MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks that can be registered/unregistered
 208:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       in READY or RESET state, thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used
 209:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       during the Init/DeInit.
 210:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       In that case first register the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 211:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       using HAL_DAC_RegisterCallback before calling HAL_DAC_DeInit 
 212:Drivers/STM32F0xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f0xx_hal_dac.c ****       or HAL_DAC_Init function.
